From 97b00012f5ffeb473c76c8375b366d2060fc6a5a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: leonieziechmann <48921293+leonieziechmann@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 10:12:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 09/15] fix(data): a cash discount period has at most 36 500
 days, as the payment days

The v3 corpus accepted Skonto days of 36 501 and 10^15; they are now a data
issue (schema maximum and decoder), with conformance fixtures and a unit test.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RaaQussN1QVEE8zRWeeCD3
---
